OL,3,AThird runway at Heathrow Airport would
OL,4,Adrive growth, Healey says
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey has said
OL,7,Fbuilding a third runway at Heathrow
OL,8,FAirport has "always been a case for
OL,9,Fgrowth", after Prime Minister Andy
OL,10,FBurnham refused to say whether he
OL,11,Fbacked the expansion.
OL,13,FSpeaking from the International
OL,14,FMonetary Fund (IMF) meetings in
OL,15,FBangkok, Healey said that airport
OL,16,Fexpansion, including at Heathrow, had
OL,17,Fbeen "a big part of jobs and growth" in
OL,18,Frecent decades.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
