OL,3,AThird runway at Heathrow Airport would
OL,4,Adrive growth, Healey says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis predecessor Rachel Reeves had put
OL,7,FHeathrow expansion at the centrepiece
OL,8,Fof an argument that Britain is open for
OL,9,Fbusiness.
OL,11,FBut Burnham has been more sceptical
OL,12,Fabout the case, telling the BBC it was
OL,13,F"a matter for London and Londoners".
